{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.closures_match","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.closures_match","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L93-L93","doc":"**Conjectural shell-transition identity.**  The corrected closures\nat levels `0..6` reproduce the seven observed stability pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.correctedClosure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.correctedClosure","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L90-L90","doc":"The spin–orbit-corrected cumulative shell closure at level `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L88-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.ShellTransitionKnot","kind":"class","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L76-L94","doc":"**Conjecture class** (`conj:shell-transition-knot`), conditional on\n    `[BorromeanQuark]`.\n\nAn instance supplies the spin–orbit-corrected cumulative closure\nfunction `correctedClosure` and asserts that its first seven values\nreproduce the observed stability pairs `{2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82, 126}` —\nwith the shell-transition threshold set at `N = 3` matching the three\nBorromean crossings (`BorromeanQuark.crossingNumber`).\n\nThe field `closures_match` carries the conjecture's genuine content (the\ncorrected closures equal the observed magic numbers), not a bare `True`.\nThe `[BorromeanQuark]` binder makes this a **dependent** conjecture. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:shell-transition-knot","label":"conj:shell-transition-knot","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/shell-transition-knot.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.crossingNumber_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.crossingNumber_eq","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L74-L74","doc":"The Borromean link has exactly three crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.crossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.crossingNumber","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L72-L72","doc":"Minimum crossing number of the Borromean link `B₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark.mk","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.BorromeanQuark","kind":"class","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L66-L74","doc":"**Borromean-baryon model** (`conj:borromean-quark`), the upstream\nconjecture this block is conditional on.  Its field records the\ncrossing count of the Borromean link `B₃` that sets the spin–orbit\nthreshold — genuine content, not a bare `True`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.stabilityPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.stabilityPairs","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L63-L64","doc":"The seven observed nuclear stability pairs (magic numbers). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_uncorrected_mismatch","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_uncorrected_mismatch","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L57-L61","doc":"Without spin–orbit coupling the closures continue `{40, 70, 112, …}`,\nwhich do **not** match the observed `{28, 50, 82, …}` — the gap the\nspin–orbit correction must close. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_first_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_first_three","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L52-L55","doc":"The first three HO closures are the (uncorrected) values\n`{2, 8, 20}` — these already match the first three magic numbers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_eq_sum_first_seven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure_eq_sum_first_seven","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L44-L50","doc":"The cumulative closure equals the explicit running sum of the shell\nsizes across the first seven levels (the standard HO bookkeeping over\nthe range that produces the magic-number candidates). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.hoClosure","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L40-L42","doc":"Cumulative HO closure at level `N`:\n`C_N = ∑_{k=0}^{N} (k+1)(k+2) = (N+1)(N+2)(N+3)/3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Conjectures.hoShellSize","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Conjectures.hoShellSize","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Conjectures/ShellTransitionKnot.lean#L37-L38","doc":"3-D harmonic-oscillator shell size at level `N`: `(N+1)(N+2)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}